{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12120","headline":"夕发箭场岩下作 · 钱起","name":"夕发箭场岩下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行役不遑安，在幽机转发。\n山谷无明晦，溪霞自兴没。\n朝栉杉下风，夕饮石上月。\n懿尔青云士，垂缨朝凤阙。\n宁知采竹人，每食慙薇蕨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}